{"seq":4,"slug":"common-writing-errors","title":"常见写作错误修正","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/writing-expression/common-writing-errors","wordCount":1117,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"常见写作错误修正\">常见写作错误修正</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>英语写作错误可以分为语法错误、词汇错误、句式错误和篇章错误四个层面。许多错误源自中文思维的直接迁移（即&quot;中式英语&quot;），另一些则是英语自身规则的陷阱。本文系统整理最常见的写作错误及其修正方法，帮助学习者写出更准确、更地道的英语。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>写作错误可按<strong>层面</strong>划分，定位层面比逐条记忆更有效率：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>中式英语（Chinglish）</strong>：中文思维直接迁移，是词汇与句式错误的共同根源，如 <code>open the TV</code>、<code>Because...so...</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>四个层面</strong>：语法错误、词汇错误、句式错误、篇章错误，层级越高越影响读者理解。</li>\n<li><strong>修正优先序</strong>：先消灭影响理解的错误（残句、逗号拼接、逻辑跳跃），再打磨用词与搭配的地道度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下图展示写作错误的分类体系：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    E[&quot;写作错误&quot;] --&gt; L1[&quot;中式英语 Chinglish&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; L2[&quot;句子层面&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; L3[&quot;词汇层面&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; L4[&quot;篇章层面&quot;]&#10;    L2 --&gt; L21[&quot;逗号拼接 / 残句 / 串句&quot;]&#10;    L2 --&gt; L22[&quot;悬垂修饰 / 平行结构&quot;]&#10;    L3 --&gt; L31[&quot;易混淆词 / 词性误用 / 搭配错误&quot;]&#10;    L4 --&gt; L41[&quot;缺主题句 / 逻辑跳跃 / 重复冗余&quot;]\">graph TD\n    E[\"写作错误\"] --&gt; L1[\"中式英语 Chinglish\"]\n    E --&gt; L2[\"句子层面\"]\n    E --&gt; L3[\"词汇层面\"]\n    E --&gt; L4[\"篇章层面\"]\n    L2 --&gt; L21[\"逗号拼接 / 残句 / 串句\"]\n    L2 --&gt; L22[\"悬垂修饰 / 平行结构\"]\n    L3 --&gt; L31[\"易混淆词 / 词性误用 / 搭配错误\"]\n    L4 --&gt; L41[\"缺主题句 / 逻辑跳跃 / 重复冗余\"]</pre><h2 id=\"中式英语-chinglish\">中式英语（Chinglish）</h2><h3 id=\"词汇层面的中式英语\">词汇层面的中式英语</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文思维</th>\n<th>中式英语</th>\n<th>地道英语</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>打开电视</td>\n<td>open the TV</td>\n<td>turn on the TV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关上灯</td>\n<td>close the light</td>\n<td>turn off the light</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习知识</td>\n<td>study knowledge</td>\n<td>acquire/gain knowledge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提高能力</td>\n<td>improve ability</td>\n<td>develop/enhance skills</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>身体很好</td>\n<td>My body is very good</td>\n<td>I am in good health</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交通方便</td>\n<td>The traffic is convenient</td>\n<td>The location is easily accessible</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>给你带来不方便</td>\n<td>bring you inconvenience</td>\n<td>cause you inconvenience</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格便宜</td>\n<td>The price is cheap</td>\n<td>The price is low / It is inexpensive</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"句式层面的中式英语\">句式层面的中式英语</h3><h4 id=\"因为-所以-双重连词\">&quot;因为…所以…&quot; 双重连词</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ Because it was raining, so we stayed home.&#10;✅ Because it was raining, we stayed home.&#10;✅ It was raining, so we stayed home.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ Because it was raining, so we stayed home.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ Because it was raining, we stayed home.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ It was raining, so we stayed home.</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"虽然-但是-双重连词\">&quot;虽然…但是…&quot; 双重连词</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ Although he is old, but he is still active.&#10;✅ Although he is old, he is still active.&#10;✅ He is old, but he is still active.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ Although he is old, but he is still active.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ Although he is old, he is still active.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ He is old, but he is still active.</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"主语缺失\">主语缺失</h4><p>中文允许省略主语，英语通常不行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ If want to succeed, must work hard.&#10;✅ If you want to succeed, you must work hard.&#10;&#10;❌ Is very important to exercise.&#10;✅ It is very important to exercise.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ If want to succeed, must work hard.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ If you want to succeed, you must work hard.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ Is very important to exercise.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ It is very important to exercise.</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"很-的过度使用\">&quot;很&quot; 的过度使用</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ I very like this book.&#10;✅ I really like this book. / I like this book very much.&#10;&#10;❌ She is very beautiful very much.&#10;✅ She is very beautiful.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ I very like this book.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ I really like this book. / I like this book very much.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ She is very beautiful very much.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ She is very beautiful.</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"句子层面的常见错误\">句子层面的常见错误</h2><h3 id=\"1-逗号拼接-comma-splice\">1. 逗号拼接（Comma Splice）</h3><p>用逗号连接两个独立句子是英语写作的常见错误：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ The weather was cold, we stayed inside.&#10;&#10;✅ 修正方法（四选一）：&#10;  (a) 加连词：The weather was cold, so we stayed inside.&#10;  (b) 用分号：The weather was cold; we stayed inside.&#10;  (c) 分成两句：The weather was cold. We stayed inside.&#10;  (d) 用从句：Because the weather was cold, we stayed inside.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ The weather was cold, we stayed inside.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ 修正方法（四选一）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (a) 加连词：The weather was cold, so we stayed inside.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (b) 用分号：The weather was cold; we stayed inside.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (c) 分成两句：The weather was cold. We stayed inside.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (d) 用从句：Because the weather was cold, we stayed inside.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"2-残句-fragment\">2. 残句（Fragment）</h3><p>缺少主语或谓语的不完整句子：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ Because I was tired. （从句不能独立成句）&#10;✅ Because I was tired, I went to bed early.&#10;&#10;❌ The student studying in the library.（缺少谓语动词）&#10;✅ The student was studying in the library.&#10;&#10;❌ For example, smartphones and laptops.（不是完整句子）&#10;✅ For example, smartphones and laptops are widely used.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ Because I was tired. （从句不能独立成句）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ Because I was tired, I went to bed early.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ The student studying in the library.（缺少谓语动词）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ The student was studying in the library.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ For example, smartphones and laptops.（不是完整句子）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ For example, smartphones and laptops are widely used.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"3-串句-run-on-sentence\">3. 串句（Run-on Sentence）</h3><p>两个独立句子没有任何连接就合在一起：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ She loves reading she goes to the library every day.&#10;✅ She loves reading, so she goes to the library every day.&#10;✅ She loves reading; she goes to the library every day.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ She loves reading she goes to the library every day.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ She loves reading, so she goes to the library every day.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ She loves reading; she goes to the library every day.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"4-悬垂修饰语-dangling-modifier\">4. 悬垂修饰语（Dangling Modifier）</h3><p>修饰语的逻辑主语与句子主语不一致：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ Walking to school, the rain started. （雨在走路？）&#10;✅ Walking to school, I got caught in the rain.&#10;&#10;❌ Having finished the homework, the TV was turned on.&#10;✅ Having finished the homework, she turned on the TV.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ Walking to school, the rain started. （雨在走路？）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ Walking to school, I got caught in the rain.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ Having finished the homework, the TV was turned on.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ Having finished the homework, she turned on the TV.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"5-平行结构错误\">5. 平行结构错误</h3><p>并列的成分应保持相同的语法形式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ She enjoys reading, swimming, and to play tennis.&#10;✅ She enjoys reading, swimming, and playing tennis.&#10;&#10;❌ The job requires patience, creativity, and being organized.&#10;✅ The job requires patience, creativity, and organization.&#10;&#10;❌ He is not only smart but also works hard.&#10;✅ He is not only smart but also hardworking.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ She enjoys reading, swimming, and to play tennis.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ She enjoys reading, swimming, and playing tennis.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ The job requires patience, creativity, and being organized.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ The job requires patience, creativity, and organization.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ He is not only smart but also works hard.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ He is not only smart but also hardworking.</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"词汇层面的常见错误\">词汇层面的常见错误</h2><h3 id=\"易混淆词对\">易混淆词对</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误用法</th>\n<th>正确用法</th>\n<th>区别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>❌ affect (n.)</td>\n<td>effect (n.)</td>\n<td>affect 是动词，effect 是名词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>❌ principle (人)</td>\n<td>principal (人)</td>\n<td>principal = 校长/主要的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>❌ complement (赞美)</td>\n<td>compliment (赞美)</td>\n<td>complement = 补充</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>❌ stationary (文具)</td>\n<td>stationery (文具)</td>\n<td>stationary = 静止的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>❌ discrete (谨慎)</td>\n<td>discreet (谨慎)</td>\n<td>discrete = 离散的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>❌ farther (更深入)</td>\n<td>further (更深入)</td>\n<td>farther = 物理距离更远</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"词性误用\">词性误用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ The develop of technology is rapid.&#10;✅ The development of technology is rapid.&#10;&#10;❌ She success in her career.&#10;✅ She succeeded in her career.&#10;&#10;❌ This is a importantly issue.&#10;✅ This is an important issue.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ The develop of technology is rapid.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ The development of technology is rapid.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ She success in her career.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ She succeeded in her career.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ This is a importantly issue.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ This is an important issue.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"搭配错误\">搭配错误</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ do a decision → ✅ make a decision&#10;❌ strong rain → ✅ heavy rain&#10;❌ open the computer → ✅ turn on the computer&#10;❌ depend of → ✅ depend on&#10;❌ married with → ✅ married to\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ do a decision → ✅ make a decision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ strong rain → ✅ heavy rain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ open the computer → ✅ turn on the computer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ depend of → ✅ depend on</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ married with → ✅ married to</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"篇章层面的常见问题\">篇章层面的常见问题</h2><h3 id=\"1-缺乏主题句\">1. 缺乏主题句</h3><p>每个段落应该有明确的主题句引领：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ （没有主题句，直接堆砌细节）&#10;Many students use smartphones. They also use laptops.&#10;Some students prefer tablets. Technology is everywhere.&#10;&#10;✅ （有主题句，逻辑清晰）&#10;Modern students rely heavily on digital devices for learning.&#10;Many use smartphones to access educational apps, while others&#10;prefer laptops for writing assignments. Tablets have also gained&#10;popularity for their portability and touchscreen functionality.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ （没有主题句，直接堆砌细节）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Many students use smartphones. They also use laptops.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Some students prefer tablets. Technology is everywhere.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ （有主题句，逻辑清晰）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Modern students rely heavily on digital devices for learning.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Many use smartphones to access educational apps, while others</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>prefer laptops for writing assignments. Tablets have also gained</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>popularity for their portability and touchscreen functionality.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"2-逻辑跳跃\">2. 逻辑跳跃</h3><p>论证缺少过渡，观点之间缺乏衔接：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ Exercise is important for health. The government should&#10;build more parks.（逻辑跳跃）&#10;&#10;✅ Exercise is important for maintaining physical and mental&#10;health. However, many urban residents lack convenient access&#10;to exercise facilities. Therefore, the government should invest&#10;in building more parks and recreational spaces to encourage&#10;physical activity.（逻辑完整）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ Exercise is important for health. The government should</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>build more parks.（逻辑跳跃）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ Exercise is important for maintaining physical and mental</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>health. However, many urban residents lack convenient access</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>to exercise facilities. Therefore, the government should invest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>in building more parks and recreational spaces to encourage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>physical activity.（逻辑完整）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"3-重复和冗余\">3. 重复和冗余</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ In my personal opinion, I think that...&#10;   （personal + opinion + I think 三重冗余）&#10;✅ In my opinion, ... 或 I believe that...&#10;&#10;❌ The reason is because...（reason 和 because 语义重复）&#10;✅ The reason is that... 或 This is because...&#10;&#10;❌ return back / repeat again / advance forward&#10;✅ return / repeat / advance\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ In my personal opinion, I think that...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   （personal + opinion + I think 三重冗余）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ In my opinion, ... 或 I believe that...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ The reason is because...（reason 和 because 语义重复）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ The reason is that... 或 This is because...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ return back / repeat again / advance forward</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ return / repeat / advance</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"写作自查清单\">写作自查清单</h2><h3 id=\"语法检查\">语法检查</h3><ul>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 主谓一致（单复数）</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 时态一致（前后统一）</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 冠词使用（a/an/the/零冠词）</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 介词搭配正确</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 无逗号拼接或残句</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"词汇检查\">词汇检查</h3><ul>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 无中式英语表达</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 词性使用正确</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 搭配地道</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 无拼写错误</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 无易混淆词误用</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"句式检查\">句式检查</h3><ul>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 平行结构对称</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 修饰语位置正确</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 句子长短搭配</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 无不必要的被动语态</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"篇章检查\">篇章检查</h3><ul>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 每段有主题句</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 段落间有过渡词衔接</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 论证逻辑清晰</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 无重复冗余表达</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 开头和结尾呼应</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐校对工具\">推荐校对工具</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Grammarly</td>\n<td>语法、拼写、风格</td>\n<td>最全面，有免费版</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ProWritingAid</td>\n<td>深度文体分析</td>\n<td>适合长文写作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hemingway Editor</td>\n<td>句子复杂度分析</td>\n<td>帮助简化表达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LanguageTool</td>\n<td>多语言语法检查</td>\n<td>开源免费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实践建议\">实践建议</h2><ul>\n<li>每次写完文章，对照自查清单逐项检查</li>\n<li>建立个人&quot;错误日志&quot;，记录反复犯的错误</li>\n<li>让母语者或工具帮你批改，关注反馈中的模式</li>\n<li>每周针对一种错误类型做专项练习</li>\n<li>多读优秀英文范文，培养正确的语感</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>写作错误分为中式英语、句子、词汇和篇章四个层面，中式英语是词汇与句式错误的共同根源。</li>\n<li>句子层面的典型错误有逗号拼接、残句、串句、悬垂修饰和平行结构错误。</li>\n<li>词汇层面需注意易混淆词对、词性误用和搭配错误。</li>\n<li>篇章层面要避免缺主题句、逻辑跳跃和重复冗余，写完可对照自查清单逐项检查。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"常见写作错误修正","id":"常见写作错误修正"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"中式英语（Chinglish）","id":"中式英语-chinglish"},{"level":3,"text":"词汇层面的中式英语","id":"词汇层面的中式英语"},{"level":3,"text":"句式层面的中式英语","id":"句式层面的中式英语"},{"level":4,"text":"\"因为…所以…\" 双重连词","id":"因为-所以-双重连词"},{"level":4,"text":"\"虽然…但是…\" 双重连词","id":"虽然-但是-双重连词"},{"level":4,"text":"主语缺失","id":"主语缺失"},{"level":4,"text":"\"很\" 的过度使用","id":"很-的过度使用"},{"level":2,"text":"句子层面的常见错误","id":"句子层面的常见错误"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 逗号拼接（Comma Splice）","id":"1-逗号拼接-comma-splice"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 残句（Fragment）","id":"2-残句-fragment"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 串句（Run-on Sentence）","id":"3-串句-run-on-sentence"},{"level":3,"text":"4. 悬垂修饰语（Dangling Modifier）","id":"4-悬垂修饰语-dangling-modifier"},{"level":3,"text":"5. 平行结构错误","id":"5-平行结构错误"},{"level":2,"text":"词汇层面的常见错误","id":"词汇层面的常见错误"},{"level":3,"text":"易混淆词对","id":"易混淆词对"},{"level":3,"text":"词性误用","id":"词性误用"},{"level":3,"text":"搭配错误","id":"搭配错误"},{"level":2,"text":"篇章层面的常见问题","id":"篇章层面的常见问题"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 缺乏主题句","id":"1-缺乏主题句"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 逻辑跳跃","id":"2-逻辑跳跃"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 重复和冗余","id":"3-重复和冗余"},{"level":2,"text":"写作自查清单","id":"写作自查清单"},{"level":3,"text":"语法检查","id":"语法检查"},{"level":3,"text":"词汇检查","id":"词汇检查"},{"level":3,"text":"句式检查","id":"句式检查"},{"level":3,"text":"篇章检查","id":"篇章检查"},{"level":2,"text":"推荐校对工具","id":"推荐校对工具"},{"level":2,"text":"实践建议","id":"实践建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"商务邮件与正式写作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/writing-expression/business-and-formal-writing"},"next":{"title":"听力策略与笔记","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/listening-and-speaking/listening-strategies"}}